"Turn on the headphones or speakers you want to use. If they're already paired with this Mac, open “Connect a device” and click them. Headshare connects them for you." = "Uključite slušalice ili zvučnike koje želite koristiti. Ako su već upareni s ovim Macom, otvorite „Spoji uređaj” i kliknite ih. Headshare ih spaja umjesto vas.";
